                </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>💰 KBSistemas Finance</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>

                </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
                    Plataforma de planejamento e controle
