        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">content</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"Conheça os projetos da KBSistemas: sistemas financeiros, controle de almoxarifado, ERP, estoque inteligente, logística reversa e sites profissionais."</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>

