                    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">ultimo</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">botoes</span><span>[</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">botoes</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>length </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">-</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span>];

                    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">if</span><span> (
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">evento</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>shiftKey </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&amp;&amp;</span><span>
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>activeElement </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">===</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">primeiro</span><span>
                    ) {
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">evento</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>preventDefault();
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">ultimo</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>focus();
                    } </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">else</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">if</span><span> (
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">!</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">evento</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>shiftKey </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&amp;&amp;</span><span>
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>activeElement </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">===</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">ultimo</span><span>
                    ) {
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">evento</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>preventDefault();
                        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">primeiro</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>focus();
                    }
                }
            });
        })();
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/script&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/body&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Rolar até o final" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-3812f8496c9df2a2.svg#arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Depois clique em </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Commit changes</span></strong><span>. Quando a atualização terminar no Render, abra o portfólio e pressione </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Ctrl + F5</span></strong><span>.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primar