t-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT disse:</h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ad215a0-31c4-83e9-872e-0fea6b11a047" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="0d9ee82e-833c-5dea-9662-7e0d9b00428e"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_2g1_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>No código que te mandei, acrescentei as informações do Almoxarifado e ajustei os cards para terem a mesma altura em cada linha.</span></strong><span> Mantive as galerias, os outros projetos e o Almoxarifado sem botão de acesso.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Mas </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>não testei essa versão no seu site</span></strong><span>, então não posso garantir que ficou tudo certo visualmente. Se apareceu algo diferente depois de colar, manda um print que eu corrijo.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled