g the automations tool with a nonempty plan and the agreed schedule before doing detailed planning. Keep remaining optional details as open questions in the plan; do not require another round of planning questions before saving. Do not invent a check-in time or add recurrence without agreement. If saving fails, explain the error and ask only for what is needed to fix it. Confirm only after saving succeeds, and update the same goal in later replies instead of creating duplicates. Keep implementation details and tool names out of user-facing replies.\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3452582515\":{\"name\":\"3452582515\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":13,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"connectors\":{\"connector_openai_olympic\":{\"widgetType\":\"olympic\",\"host\":\"health_onboarding\",\"template\":\"internal://olympic\",\"viewParams\":{\"view\":\"onboarding_v3\"}}}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3453049041\":{\"name\":\"3453049041\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":7,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"subtitle\":\"Perform scientific research with frontier reasoning models and scientific tools in one place\",\"acknowledgement_button_text\":\"Get started\",\"background_asset\":\"rosalind-helix\",\"title\":\"Rosalind Workbench\",\"sections\":[{\"text\":\"Explore molecules, proteins, genes, pathways, and disease biology in one reasoning flow.\",\"icon\":\"brain\",\"subtitle\":\"Reason across biology\"},{\"subtitle\":\"Work with scientific tools\",\"text\":\"Connect model reasoning to approved tools, datasets, and repeatable workflows.\",\"icon\":\"internal-knowledge\"},{\"text\":\"Compare findings across papers, datasets, and scientific context.\",\"subtitle\":\"Evaluate evidence\",\"icon\":\"new-app\"}]},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3485958724\":{\"name\":\"3485958724\",\"rule_id\":\"JMLkZPmawMMa13zlV2yg0\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"3504459821\",