\"Site KB Lashes de cílios e sobrancelhas\\\"\\n[L879]                     loading=\\\"lazy\\\"\\n[L880]                     onclick=\\\"abrirImagem(this)\\\"\\n                \u003e\\n[L882]                 \u003cspan class=\\\"projeto-ampliar\\\"\u003e\\n[L883]                     ⤢ Ampliar imagem\\n[L884]                 \u003c/span\u003e\\n[L885]             \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n[L887]             \u003cdiv class=\\\"projeto-corpo\\\"\u003e\\n\\n[L889]                 \u003cspan class=\\\"projeto-tag\\\"\u003e\\n[L890]                     SITE COMERCIAL • BELEZA\\n[L891]                 \u003c/span\u003e\\n\\n[L893]                 \u003ch3\u003e💗 KB Lashes\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cp\u003e\\n[L896]                     Site personalizado para um negócio de\\n[L897]                     beleza, especializado em cílios e\\n[L898]                     sobrancelhas. Apresenta identidade visual,\\n[L899]                     serviços, valores e acesso ao agendamento.\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n[L902]                 \u003cdiv class=\\\"projeto-recursos\\\"\u003e\\n[L903]                     \u003cspan\u003e💅 Beleza\u003c/span\u003e\\n[L904]                     \u003cspan\u003e📅 Agendamento\u003c/span\u003e\\n[L905]                     \u003cspan\u003e💰 Valores\u003c/span\u003e\\n[L906]                     \u003cspan\u003e📱 Responsivo\u003c/span\u003e\\n[L907]                 \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n[L909]                 \u003cdiv class=\\\"projeto-botoes\\\"\u003e\\n[L910]                     \u003ca class=\\\"btn-projeto\\\" href=\\\"/orcamento\\\"\u003e\\n[L911]                         Quero um site assim →\\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\\n[L913]                 \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n[L915]             \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n[L917]         \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n[L919]         \u003c!-- =====================================\\n[L920]              PROJETO 5 - WARZONE\\n[L921]              ===================================== --\u003e