1047\":1048,\"_1049\":1050,\"_1051\":1052,\"_1053\":1054,\"_1055\":1056,\"_1057\":1058,\"_1059\":1060,\"_1061\":1062,\"_1063\":1064},\"Bora, meu mano\\\\! 🔥💙 Vamos transformar o **KBSistemas Finance** em mais um sistema de verdade para o portfólio da KBSistemas.\\n\\nVamos criar uma aplicação web com dois ambientes: **Finanças Pessoais** e **Finanças Empresariais**\\\\. O usuário poderá alternar entre eles sem misturar os lançamentos.\\n\\nA primeira versão terá cadastro e login, dashboard, receitas, despesas, categorias, metas financeiras e histórico de movimentações. Também vamos preparar o projeto para funcionar no computador e depois publicar no Render.\\n\\n## Etapa 1 — Estrutura do projeto\\n\\n```text\\nkbsistemas-finance/\\n├── app.py\\n├── requirements.txt\\n├── .env.example\\n├── .gitignore\\n├── templates/\\n│   ├── base.html\\n│   ├── login.html\\n│   ├── cadastro.html\\n│   ├── dashboard.html\\n│   ├── movimentacoes.html\\n│   └── metas.html\\n└── static/\\n    └── css/\\n        └── style.css\\n```\\n\\nO visual seguirá a identidade da agência: fundo escuro, azul tecnológico, cartões modernos e interface responsiva.\\n\\nVou organizar o código em um projeto completo para você não precisar montar cada arquivo do zero.\\n\\n## Etapa 2 — Projeto completo pronto\\n\\n**KBSistemas Finance — Código-fonte**\\n\\nArquivo ZIP com Python, HTML, CSS e configuração do banco de dados.\\n\\n[Baixar o projeto completo](sandbox:/mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance.zip)\\n\\nJá deixei os arquivos organizados. O projeto inclui\\\\:\\n\\n- Cadastro e login com senhas protegidas por hash.\\n- Ambientes pessoal e empresarial separados por usuário.\\n- Cadastro e exclusão de receitas e despesas.\\n- Dashboard com saldo, totais do mês e despesas por categoria.\\n- Metas financeiras com barra de progresso.\\n- Banco SQLite para desenvolvimento e suporte a PostgreSQL para produção.\\n- Layout escuro e responsivo da KBSistemas.\\n\\nO código Python passou pela verificação de sintaxe. Ainda precisamos executar e testar os fluxos da aplicação antes de considerá-la pronta para clientes.\\n\\n## Etapa 3 — Como instalar no computador\\n\\nPrimeiro, extraia o ZIP. Depois, abra a pasta `kbsistemas-finance` no VS Code.\\n\\nNo terminal do VS Code, execute os comandos abaixo, um por vez.\\n\\n**1\\\\. Criar o ambiente virtual**\\n\\n```powershell\\npy -m venv .venv\\n```\\n\\n**2\\\\. Ativar o ambiente**\\n\\n```powershell\\n.\\\\.venv\\\\Scripts\\\\Activate.ps1\\n```\\n\\n**3\\\\. Instalar as bibliotecas**\\n\\n```powershell\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n```\\n\\n**4\\\\. Executar o sistema**\\n\\n```powershell\\npython app.py\\n```\\n\\nQuando aparecer o endereço local, abra no navegador\\\\:\\n\\nurlhttp\\\\://127.0.0.1:5000http://127.0.0.1:5000\\n\\nVocê verá a tela de login. Clique em **Criar conta**, cadastre um usuário e entre no painel financeiro.\\n\\n## Etapa 4 — Como o sistema vai funcionar\\n\\n**KB FINANCE**\\n\\n## Painel financeiro\\n\\nExemplo ilustrativo do dashboard\\n\\n(Empresarial)\\n\\nSaldo acumulado\\n\\n## R\\\\$ 8.450\\n\\nReceitas do mês\\n\\n## R\\\\$ 12.800\\n\\nDespesas do mês\\n\\n## R\\\\$ 4.350\\n\\nResultado mensal\\n\\n## R\\\\$ 8.450\\n\\n**Distribuição de despesas**\\n\\n## Etapa 5 — Publicar no GitHub e Render\\n\\nDepois de testar no computador\\\\:\\n\\n1. Crie um repositório chamado `kbsistemas-finance` no GitHub.\\n2. Envie os arquivos extraídos, mantendo as pastas `templates` e `static`\\\\.\\n3. No Render, crie um **Web Service** conectado ao repositório.\\n4. Configure os campos abaixo.\\n\\n| Configuração | Valor |\\n|--------|--------|\\n| Language | Python |\\n| Build Command | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |\\n| Start Command | `gunicorn app:app` |\\n| Health Check Path | `/health` |\\n\\nNas variáveis de ambiente, configure `SECRET_KEY` com uma chave aleatória forte e `DATABASE_URL` com a conexão de um banco PostgreSQL persistente. **Não publique usando o SQLite temporário do Render**, pois os dados podem ser perdidos.\\n\\nAntes de vender ou colocar dados financeiros reais no sistema, também precisaremos adicionar migrações de banco, recuperação de senha, testes, backups e revisão de segurança.\\n\\n**Nossa próxima etapa é testar o sistema funcionando.** Comece baixando o ZIP e seguindo os comandos da Etapa 3. Quando abrir a tela de login, me mande um print e seguimos com as melhorias do KBSistemas Finance. 💙\",[916],[514],\"clientDefinedWidgets\",{\"_902\":903,\"_904\":905,\"_906\":907,\"_908\":909,\"_910\":911},{\"_428\":891},{\"_430\":892,\"_432\":433,\"_434\":893},{\"_508\":894,\"_895\":896},{},{\"_313\":510,\"_511\":900,\"_513\":514},\"dedf923e-efb9-5796-821d-1bd07d4a9183\",{\"_313\":510,\"_511\":897,\"_61\":898,\"_513\":514},{\"_515\":869,\"_37\":899,\"_517\":899,\"_518\":899,\"_69\":-5,\"_519\":-5,\"_520\":-5,\"_521\":522,\"_523\":899},[869],\"127.0.0.1\",{\"_515\":901,\"_37\":901,\"_517\":901,\"_518\":-5,\"_69\":-5,\"_519\":-5,\"_520\":-5,\"_521\":522,\"_523\":901},\"sandbox:/mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance.zip\",\"12221c35-b136-526c-91ff-027316b55c49\",{\"_313\":510,\"_912\":30,\"_913\":50},\"b649963e-30c7-5abc-885b-9fab53842e15\",{\"_313\":510,\"_912\":382,\"_913\":50},\"dadb3bb8-91d4-5e93-ad87-bf692e6b9cc6\",{\"_313\":510,\"_912\":915,\"_913\":50},\"3b9af960-a63c-5833-b7c9-123de04b94b7\",{\"_313\":510,\"_912\":914,\"_913\":50},\"34c4b475-a145-5808-b6d1-905d53a0f63b\",{\"_313\":510,\"_912\":26,\"_913\":50},\"refIndex\",\"isStreaming\",3,2,{\"_419\":525,\"_526\":527,\"_528\":529,\"_530\":50},\"Bora, meu mano! 🔥💙 Vamos transformar o \",\" em mais um sistema de verdade para o portfólio da KBSistemas.\",\"Vamos criar uma aplicação web com dois ambientes: \",\"Finanças Pessoais\",\" e \",\"Finanças Empresariais\",\". O usuário poderá alternar entre eles sem misturar os lançamentos.\",\"A primeira versão terá cadastro e login, dashboard, receitas, despesas, categorias, metas financeiras e histórico de movimentações. Também vamos preparar o projeto para funcionar no computador e depois publicar no Render.\",\"Etapa 1 — Estrutura do projeto\",\"O visual seguirá a identidade da agência: fundo escuro, azul tecnológico, cartões modernos e interface responsiva.\",\"Vou organizar o código em um projeto completo para você não precisar montar cada arquivo do zero.\",\"Etapa 2 — Projeto completo pronto\",\"KBSistemas Finance — Código-fonte\",\"Arquivo ZIP com Python, HTML, CSS e configuração do banco de dados.\",\" Baixar o projeto completo\",\"Já deixei os arquivos organizados. O projeto inclui:\",\"Cadastro e login com senhas protegidas por hash.\",\"Ambientes pessoal e empresarial separados por usuário.\",\"Cadastro e exclusão de receitas e despesas.\",\"Dashboard com saldo, totais do mês e despesas por categoria.\",\"Metas financeiras com barra de progresso.\",\"Banco SQLite para desenvolvimento e suporte a PostgreSQL para produção.\",\"Layout escuro e responsivo da KBSistemas.\",\"O código Python passou pela verificação de sintaxe. Ainda precisamos executar e testar os fluxos da aplicação antes de considerá-la pronta para clientes.\",\"Etapa 3 — Como instalar no computador\",\"Primeiro, extraia o ZIP. Depois, abra a pasta \",\"kbsistemas-finance\",\" no VS Code.\",\"No terminal do VS Code, execute os comandos abaixo, um por vez.\",\"33\",\"1. Criar o ambiente virtual\",\"34\",\"35\",\"36\",\"2. Ativar o ambiente\",\"37\",\"38\",\"39\",\"3. Instalar as bibliotecas\",\"40\",\"41\",\"42\",\"4. Executar o sistema\",\"43\",\"44\",\"45\",\"Quando aparecer o endereço local, abra no navegador:\",\"46\",\"47\",\"48\",\"Você verá a tela de login. Clique em \",\"49\",\"Criar conta\",\"50\",\", cadastre um usuário e entre no painel financeiro.\",\"51\",\"Etapa 4 — Como o sistema vai funcionar\",\"52\",\"KB FINANCE\",\"53\",\"Painel financeiro\",\"54\",\"Exemplo ilustrativo do dashboard\",\"55\",\"Empresarial\",\"56\",\"Saldo acumulado\",\"57\",\"R$ 8.450\",\"58\",\"Receitas do mês\",\"59\",\"R$ 12.800\",\"60\",\"Despesas do mês\",\"61\",\"R$ 4.350\",\"62\",\"Resultado mensal\",\"63\",\"64\",\"Distribuição de despesas\",\"65\",\"%\",\"66\",\"Etapa 5 — Publicar no GitHub e Render\",\"67\",\"Depois de testar no computador:\",\"68\",\"Crie um repositório chamado \",\"69\",\"70\",\" no GitHub.\",\"71\",\"Envie os arquivos extraídos, mantendo as pastas \",\"72\",\"templates\",\"73\",\"74\",\"static\",\"75\",\"76\",\"No Render, crie um \",\"77\",\"Web Service\",\"78\",\" conectado ao repositório.\",\"79\",\"Configure os campos abaixo.\",\"80\",\"Configuração\",\"81\",\"Valor\",\"82\",\"Language\",\"83\",\"Python\",\"84\",\"Build Command\",\"85\",\"86\",\"Start Command\",\"87\",\"gunicorn app:app\",\"88\",\"Health Check Path\",\"89\",\"/health\",\"90\",\"Nas variáveis de ambiente, configure \",\"91\",\"SECRET_KEY\",\"92\",\" com uma chave aleatória forte e \",\"93\",\"DATABASE_URL\",\"94\",\" com a conexão de um banco PostgreSQL persistente. \",\"95\",\"Não publique usando o SQLite temporário do Render\",\"96\",\", pois os dados podem ser perdidos.\",\"97\",\"Antes de vender ou colocar dados financeiros reais no sistema, também precisaremos adicionar migrações de banco, recuperação de senha, testes, backups e revisão de segurança.\",\"98\",\"Nossa próxima etapa é testar o sistema funcionando.\",\"99\",\" Comece baixando o ZIP e seguindo os comandos da Etapa 3. Quando abrir a tela de login, me mande um print e seguimos com as melhorias do KBSistemas Finance. 💙\",\"693d83a1-395f-4254-bd85-17889386a194\",\"784dc010-9991-4b2f-bd37-6bc6d7ba1f6f\",[1068],\"Bora, meu mano! 🔥💙 Vamos transformar o **KBSistemas Finance** em mais um sistema de verdade para o portfólio da KBSistemas.\\n\\nVamos criar uma aplicação web com dois ambientes: **Finanças Pessoais** e **Finanças Empresariais**. O usuário poderá alternar entre eles sem misturar os lançamentos.\\n\\nA primeira versão terá cadastro e login, dashboard, receitas, despesas, categorias, metas financeiras e histórico de movimentações. Também vamos preparar o projeto para funcionar no computador e depois publicar no Render.\\n\\n## Etapa 1 — Estrutura do projeto\\n\\n```text\\nkbsistemas-finance/\\n├── app.py\\n├── requirements.txt\\n├── .env.example\\n├── .gitignore\\n├── templates/\\n│   ├── base.html\\n│   ├── login.html\\n│   ├── cadastro.html\\n│   ├── dashboard.html\\n│   ├── movimentacoes.html\\n│   └── metas.html\\n└── static/\\n    └── css/\\n        └── style.css\\n```\\n\\nO visual seguirá a identidade da agência: fundo escuro, azul tecnológico, cartões modernos e interface responsiva.\\n\\nVou organizar o código em um projeto completo para você não precisar montar cada arquivo do zero.\\n\\n## Etapa 2 — Projeto completo pronto\\n\\n\u003cbox border radius=\\\"xl\\\" padding={3} gap={2}\u003e\\n  \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" gap={3}\u003e\\n    \u003cbox background=\\\"surface-secondary\\\" radius=\\\"lg\\\" padding={3}\u003e\\n      \u003cicon name=\\\"file-archive\\\" size=\\\"xl\\\" color=\\\"info\\\"/\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003cbox flex=\\\"1\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      **KBSistemas Finance — Código-fonte**\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"xs\\\"\u003eArquivo ZIP com Python, HTML, CSS e configuração do banco de dados.\u003c/text\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n  \u003c/row\u003e\\n  [\u003cicon name=\\\"download\\\" inline/\u003e Baixar o projeto completo](sandbox:/mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance.zip)\\n\u003c/box\u003e\\n\\nJá deixei os arquivos organizados. O projeto inclui:\\n\\n- Cadastro e login com senhas protegidas por hash.\\n- Ambientes pessoal e empresarial separados por usuário.\\n- Cadastro e exclusão de receitas e despesas.\\n- Dashboard com saldo, totais do mês e despesas por categoria.\\n- Metas financeiras com barra de progresso.\\n- Banco SQLite para desenvolvimento e suporte a PostgreSQL para produção.\\n- Layout escuro e responsivo da KBSistemas.\\n\\nO código Python passou pela verificação de sintaxe. Ainda precisamos executar e testar os fluxos da aplicação antes de considerá-la pronta para clientes.\\n\\n## Etapa 3 — Como instalar no computador\\n\\nPrimeiro, extraia o ZIP. Depois, abra a pasta `kbsistemas-finance` no VS Code.\\n\\nNo terminal do VS Code, execute os comandos abaixo, um por vez.\\n\\n**1. Criar o ambiente virtual**\\n\\n```powershell\\npy -m venv .venv\\n```\\n\\n**2. Ativar o ambiente**\\n\\n```powershell\\n.\\\\.venv\\\\Scripts\\\\Activate.ps1\\n```\\n\\n**3. Instalar as bibliotecas**\\n\\n```powershell\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n```\\n\\n**4. Executar o sistema**\\n\\n```powershell\\npython app.py\\n```\\n\\nQuando aparecer o endereço local, abra no navegador:\\n\\n\u003ctext color=\\\"default\\\" weight=\\\"medium\\\"\u003ehttp://127.0.0.1:5000\u003c/text\u003e\\n\\nVocê verá a tela de login. Clique em **Criar conta**, cadastre um usuário e entre no painel financeiro.\\n\\n## Etapa 4 — Como o sistema vai funcionar\\n\\n\u003cbox background=\\\"#080e18\\\" theme=\\\"dark\\\" radius=\\\"2xl\\\" padding={3} gap={3}\u003e\\n  \u003crow align=\\\"center\\\" justify=\\\"between\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cbox gap={1}\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"#6bbaff\\\" weight=\\\"bold\\\" size=\\\"xs\\\"\u003eKB FINANCE\u003c/text\u003e\\n      \u003ctitle size=\\\"lg\\\"\u003ePainel financeiro\u003c/title\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"xs\\\"\u003eExemplo ilustrativo do dashboard\u003c/text\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003cbadge\u003eEmpresarial\u003c/badge\u003e\\n  \u003c/row\u003e\\n  \u003cgrid columns={2} gap={2}\u003e\\n    \u003cbox background=\\\"#142237\\\" padding={3} radius=\\\"lg\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"2xs\\\"\u003eSaldo acumulado\u003c/text\u003e\\n      \u003ctitle size=\\\"lg\\\" color=\\\"#73bdff\\\"\u003eR$ 8.450\u003c/title\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003cbox background=\\\"#142237\\\" padding={3} radius=\\\"lg\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"2xs\\\"\u003eReceitas do mês\u003c/text\u003e\\n      \u003ctitle size=\\\"lg\\\" color=\\\"#69dcae\\\"\u003eR$ 12.800\u003c/title\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003cbox background=\\\"#142237\\\" padding={3} radius=\\\"lg\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"2xs\\\"\u003eDespesas do mês\u003c/text\u003e\\n      \u003ctitle size=\\\"lg\\\" color=\\\"#ff919b\\\"\u003eR$ 4.350\u003c/title\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n    \u003cbox background=\\\"#142237\\\" padding={3} radius=\\\"lg\\\" gap={1}\u003e\\n      \u003ctext color=\\\"secondary\\\" size=\\\"2xs\\\"\u003eResultado mensal\u003c/text\u003e\\n      \u003ctitle size=\\\"lg\\\" color=\\\"#73bdff\\\"\u003eR$ 8.450\u003c/title\u003e\\n    \u003c/box\u003e\\n  \u003c/grid\u003e\\n  \u003cbox background=\\\"#142237\\\" padding={3} radius=\\\"lg\\\" gap={2}\u003e\\n    **Distribuição de despesas**\\n    {#each [{name:\\\"Funcionários\\\",value:55},{name:\\\"Fornecedores\\\",value:30},{name:\\\"Marketing\\\",value:15}] as item}\\n      \u003cbox gap={1}\u003e\\n        \u003crow justify=\\\"between\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003ctext size=\\\"xs\\\"\u003e{item.name}\u003c/text\u003e\\n          \u003ctext size=\\\"xs\\\" color=\\\"secondary\\\"\u003e{item.value}%\u003c/text\u003e\\n        \u003c/row\u003e\\n        \u003cbox background=\\\"#293c51\\\" height=\\\"8px\\\" radius=\\\"full\\\" clip\u003e\\n          \u003cbox background=\\\"#379eff\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" width={`${item.value}%`} radius=\\\"full\\\"/\u003e\\n        \u003c/box\u003e\\n      \u003c/box\u003e\\n    {/each}\\n  \u003c/box\u003e\\n\u003c/box\u003e\\n\\n## Etapa 5 — Publicar no GitHub e Render\\n\\nDepois de testar no computador:\\n\\n1. Crie um repositório chamado `kbsistemas-finance` no GitHub.\\n2. Envie os arquivos extraídos, mantendo as pastas `templates` e `static`.\\n3. No Render, crie um **Web Service** conectado ao repositório.\\n4. Configure os campos abaixo.\\n\\n| Configuração | Valor |\\n|---|---|\\n| Language | Python |\\n| Build Command | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |\\n| Start Command | `gunicorn app:app` |\\n| Health Check Path | `/health` |\\n\\nNas variáveis de ambiente, configure `SECRET_KEY` com uma chave aleatória forte e `DATABASE_URL` com a conexão de um banco PostgreSQL persistente. **Não publique usando o SQLite temporário do Render**, pois os dados podem ser perdidos.\\n\\nAntes de vender ou colocar dados financeiros reais no sistema, também precisaremos adicionar migrações de banco, recuperação de senha, testes, backups e revisão de segurança.\\n\\n**Nossa próxima etapa é testar o sistema funcionando.** Comece baixando o ZIP e seguindo os comandos da Etapa 3. Quando abrir a tela de login, me mande um print e seguimos com as melhorias do KBSistemas Finance. 💙\",{},{\"_456\":457,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1081},1791991871.195544,{\"_451\":593,\"_377\":1080},{\"_578\":579,\"_580\":1074,\"_582\":1075,\"_584\":1076,\"_586\":587,\"_403\":404,\"_588\":1077,\"_405\":50,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_400\":328,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_414\":50,\"_415\":1078,\"_591\":17,\"_417\":1079},98,1791991773.1137633,1791991871.1716034,\"91e05e40-cacd-44e4-bc26-1cb59cf47482\",\"bf3f42e0-cb29-48d6-b718-2b30a09440ff\",[],\"Pensou por 1m 38s\",{},{\"_456\":457,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1101},1791991871.189645,1791991871.230015,{\"_451\":611,\"_611\":1096,\"_613\":1097},{\"_600\":1087,\"_578\":602,\"_603\":604,\"_605\":1088,\"_582\":1075,\"_403\":404,\"_588\":1077,\"_405\":50,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_400\":328,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_414\":50,\"_415\":1089,\"_591\":17,\"_417\":1090},{\"_478\":1091},[419],\"12d47d5f-9250-48ac-a3de-edf5f47b9714\",[],[1092,1093,1094,1095],\"a4816256-304b-4dcc-ba99-c812de3732aa\",\"b0dc16d0-2211-4ce5-9500-fde72c40cbb3\",\"25cdfc1f-a028-4581-b60a-cf610bde68f3\",\"12c47396-b753-4630-9619-564247f5b6a3\",[1098],\"e94decc0-2693-49a9-97d1-1922b3e62301\",{\"_616\":1099,\"_377\":522,\"_618\":1100,\"_620\":17},\"Construído projeto Flask financeiro completo com templates HTML\",[],{},{\"_456\":638,\"_458\":639,\"_383\":1111},1791991862.557251,{\"_451\":637,\"_452\":1109},{\"_400\":328,\"_591\":17,\"_626\":17,\"_403\":404,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_415\":1106,\"_628\":-5,\"_629\":-5,\"_578\":602,\"_605\":1107,\"_631\":1108,\"_582\":1075,\"_588\":1077,\"_414\":50},\"063bfd0a-b4d2-40e7-bb81-0e5e95f2752a\",[419],{\"_633\":1109,\"_313\":635,\"_338\":1110},\"-rw-r--r-- 1 root oai_shared 12K Oct 14 15:30 /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance.zip\\n\",[],{},{\"_456\":457,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1126},1791991859.250064,{\"_451\":419,\"_656\":657,\"_658\":-5,\"_452\":1125},{\"_389\":1116,\"_391\":17,\"_392\":1117,\"_394\":1118,\"_400\":328,\"_591\":17,\"_626\":17,\"_403\":404,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_415\":1119,\"_628\":1120,\"_629\":1121,\"_578\":602,\"_605\":1122,\"_582\":1075,\"_588\":1077,\"_417\":1123,\"_414\":50},{\"_446\":447,\"_448\":1124},[],[],\"38c85fec-4218-4f1e-9dfa-cf59249ca11e\",[1121],\"Criando templates HTML do KB Finance\",[419],[],[655],\"bash -lc cat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/base.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\u003chtml lang=\\\"pt-BR\\\"\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"\u003e\u003cmeta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"\u003e\u003ctitle\u003e{% block title %}KB Finance{% endblock %} | KBSistemas\u003c/title\u003e\u003clink rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"{{ url_for('static', filename='css/style.css') }}\\\"\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cheader class=\\\"top\\\"\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"brand\\\" href=\\\"{{ url_for('index') }}\\\"\u003eKB\u003cspan\u003eFinance\u003c/span\u003e\u003csmall\u003e by KBSistemas\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/a\u003e{% if session.get('user_id') %}\u003cnav\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('dashboard') }}\\\"\u003eDashboard\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('movimentacoes') }}\\\"\u003eMovimentações\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('metas') }}\\\"\u003eMetas\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/nav\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"actions\\\"\u003e\u003cform action=\\\"{{ url_for('trocar_modo') }}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003cselect name=\\\"mode\\\" onchange=\\\"this.form.submit()\\\" aria-label=\\\"Ambiente financeiro\\\"\u003e\u003coption value=\\\"pessoal\\\" {% if mode=='pessoal' %}selected{% endif %}\u003e👤 Pessoal\u003c/option\u003e\u003coption value=\\\"empresa\\\" {% if mode=='empresa' %}selected{% endif %}\u003e🏢 Empresa\u003c/option\u003e\u003c/select\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003cform action=\\\"{{ url_for('sair') }}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"ghost\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\"\u003eSair\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% endif %}\u003c/header\u003e\u003cmain class=\\\"container\\\"\u003e{% with messages=get_flashed_messages(with_categories=true) %}{% for category,message in messages %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"alert {{ category }}\\\"\u003e{{ message }}\u003c/div\u003e{% endfor %}{% endwith %}{% block content %}{% endblock %}\u003c/main\u003e\u003cfooter\u003e© 2026 KBSistemas — KB Finance · Controle financeiro\u003c/footer\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/login.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n{% extends 'base.html' %}{% block title %}Entrar{% endblock %}{% block content %}\u003csection class=\\\"auth panel\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"eyebrow\\\"\u003eBEM-VINDO AO KB FINANCE\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003eSeu dinheiro, sob controle.\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eEntre para acompanhar suas finanças pessoais e empresariais.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" class=\\\"form\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003clabel\u003eE-mail\u003cinput type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required autocomplete=\\\"email\\\" maxlength=\\\"180\\\"\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eSenha\u003cinput type=\\\"password\\\" name=\\\"password\\\" required autocomplete=\\\"current-password\\\"\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"button\\\"\u003eEntrar →\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eAinda não tem conta? \u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('cadastro') }}\\\"\u003eCriar conta\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e{% endblock %}\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/cadastro.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n{% extends 'base.html' %}{% block title %}Criar conta{% endblock %}{% block content %}\u003csection class=\\\"auth panel\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"eyebrow\\\"\u003eCOMECE AGORA\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003eCrie sua conta\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eOrganize suas finanças em um só lugar.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" class=\\\"form\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003clabel\u003eNome\u003cinput name=\\\"name\\\" required minlength=\\\"2\\\" maxlength=\\\"100\\\" autocomplete=\\\"name\\\"\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eE-mail\u003cinput type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required maxlength=\\\"180\\\" autocomplete=\\\"email\\\"\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eSenha (mínimo 8 caracteres)\u003cinput type=\\\"password\\\" name=\\\"password\\\" required minlength=\\\"8\\\" autocomplete=\\\"new-password\\\"\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"button\\\"\u003eCriar conta →\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eJá tem conta? \u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('login') }}\\\"\u003eEntrar\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e{% endblock %}\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/dashboard.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n{% extends 'base.html' %}{% block title %}Dashboard{% endblock %}{% block content %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"pagehead\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"eyebrow\\\"\u003ePAINEL {{ modes[mode]|upper }}\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003eOlá, {{ user.name }} 👋\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eAcompanhe seu dinheiro e tome decisões melhores.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"button\\\" href=\\\"{{ url_for('movimentacoes') }}\\\"\u003e+ Novo lançamento\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"stats\\\"\u003e\u003carticle class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSaldo acumulado\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"blue\\\"\u003e{{ balance|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csmall\u003eReceitas menos despesas de todo o período\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/article\u003e\u003carticle class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReceitas neste mês\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"green\\\"\u003e{{ income|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csmall\u003eAté {{ today.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/article\u003e\u003carticle class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDespesas neste mês\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"red\\\"\u003e{{ expense|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003csmall\u003eAté {{ today.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/article\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"columns\\\"\u003e\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"sectionhead\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eÚltimas movimentações\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"{{ url_for('movimentacoes') }}\\\"\u003eVer todas →\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% if recent %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"entries\\\"\u003e{% for item in recent %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"entry\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003e{{ item.description }}\u003c/b\u003e\u003csmall\u003e{{ item.category }} · {{ item.occurred_on.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"{{ 'green' if item.kind=='receita' else 'red' }}\\\"\u003e{{ '+' if item.kind=='receita' else '−' }} {{ item.amount|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% endfor %}\u003c/div\u003e{% else %}\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eNenhum lançamento neste ambiente ainda.\u003c/p\u003e{% endif %}\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDespesas por categoria\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eDistribuição no mês atual\u003c/p\u003e{% if by_category %}{% for category,total in by_category %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"category\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"between\\\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e{{ category }}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e{{ total|brl }}\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"track\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\\\"width:{{ ((total / expense * 100) if expense else 0)|round(1) }}%\\\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% endfor %}{% else %}\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eAs categorias aparecem após cadastrar despesas.\u003c/p\u003e{% endif %}\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% endblock %}\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/movimentacoes.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n{% extends 'base.html' %}{% block title %}Movimentações{% endblock %}{% block content %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"pagehead\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"eyebrow\\\"\u003e{{ modes[mode]|upper }}\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003eMovimentações\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eCadastre receitas e despesas do seu ambiente.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNovo lançamento\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" class=\\\"form form-grid\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003clabel\u003eTipo\u003cselect name=\\\"kind\\\" required\u003e\u003coption value=\\\"receita\\\"\u003eReceita (entrada)\u003c/option\u003e\u003coption value=\\\"despesa\\\"\u003eDespesa (saída)\u003c/option\u003e\u003c/select\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eDescrição\u003cinput name=\\\"description\\\" maxlength=\\\"160\\\" placeholder=\\\"Ex.: Pagamento de cliente\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eCategoria\u003cselect name=\\\"category\\\" required\u003e{% for category in categories[mode] %}\u003coption value=\\\"{{ category }}\\\"\u003e{{ category }}\u003c/option\u003e{% endfor %}\u003c/select\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eValor (R$)\u003cinput type=\\\"number\\\" name=\\\"amount\\\" min=\\\"0.01\\\" max=\\\"9999999999.99\\\" step=\\\"0.01\\\" placeholder=\\\"0,00\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eData\u003cinput type=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"occurred_on\\\" value=\\\"{{ today.isoformat() }}\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"button\\\"\u003eSalvar lançamento →\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eHistórico \u003csmall class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003e(até 200 registros recentes)\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e{% if records %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"entries\\\"\u003e{% for item in records %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"entry\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003e{{ item.description }}\u003c/b\u003e\u003csmall\u003e{{ item.category }} · {{ item.occurred_on.strftime('%d/%m/%Y') }}\u003c/small\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"entry-right\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"{{ 'green' if item.kind=='receita' else 'red' }}\\\"\u003e{{ '+' if item.kind=='receita' else '−' }} {{ item.amount|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{ url_for('excluir_movimentacao',item_id=item.id) }}\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return confirm('Excluir este lançamento?')\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"danger\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\"\u003eExcluir\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e{% endfor %}\u003c/div\u003e{% else %}\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eNenhuma movimentação cadastrada.\u003c/p\u003e{% endif %}\u003c/section\u003e{% endblock %}\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/templates/metas.html \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n{% extends 'base.html' %}{% block title %}Metas{% endblock %}{% block content %}\u003cdiv class=\\\"pagehead\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"eyebrow\\\"\u003e{{ modes[mode]|upper }}\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003eMetas financeiras\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003ePlaneje e acompanhe seus objetivos.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003eNova meta\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" class=\\\"form form-grid\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003clabel\u003eObjetivo\u003cinput name=\\\"title\\\" maxlength=\\\"120\\\" placeholder=\\\"Ex.: Reserva de emergência\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003clabel\u003eValor desejado (R$)\u003cinput type=\\\"number\\\" name=\\\"target\\\" min=\\\"0.01\\\" max=\\\"9999999999.99\\\" step=\\\"0.01\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"button\\\"\u003eCriar meta →\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"goal-grid\\\"\u003e{% for goal in goals %}\u003carticle class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"sectionhead\\\"\u003e\u003ch2\u003e{{ goal.title }}\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{ url_for('excluir_meta',item_id=goal.id) }}\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return confirm('Excluir esta meta?')\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"danger\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\"\u003eExcluir\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"between\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\\\"blue\\\"\u003e{{ goal.saved|brl }}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003ede {{ goal.target|brl }}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\\\"track\\\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\\\"width:{{ ([((goal.saved / goal.target) * 100), 100]|min)|round(1) }}%\\\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003e{{ ((goal.saved / goal.target) * 100)|round(1) }}% alcançado\u003c/p\u003e\u003cform method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{ url_for('adicionar_meta',item_id=goal.id) }}\\\" class=\\\"form inline-form\\\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"_csrf\\\" value=\\\"{{ csrf_token }}\\\"\u003e\u003clabel\u003eAdicionar progresso (R$)\u003cinput type=\\\"number\\\" name=\\\"amount\\\" min=\\\"0.01\\\" step=\\\"0.01\\\" required\u003e\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbutton class=\\\"button\\\"\u003eAdicionar\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/form\u003e\u003c/article\u003e{% else %}\u003csection class=\\\"panel\\\"\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted\\\"\u003eVocê ainda não criou metas neste ambiente.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e{% endfor %}\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp class=\\\"muted note\\\"\u003eAtenção: o progresso de metas é informativo e não movimenta automaticamente o saldo ou cria lançamentos.\u003c/p\u003e{% endblock %}\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/static/css/style.css \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#080c12;--panel:#111a26;--border:#263447;--text:#f2f6fc;--muted:#a5b2c3;--blue:#379eff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 65% 0,rgba(38,111,195,.11),transparent 40%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}a{color:#7bc5ff;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;padding:18px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1200px)/2));background:#0c131d;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-wrap:wrap}.brand{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;color:white;white-space:nowrap}.brand span{color:#54b0ff}.brand small{font-size:10px;color:#8aa0b6;font-weight:500}.top nav,.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.top nav a{color:#c0d0e0}.actions{gap:9px}.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:55px 24px 80px;min-height:calc(100vh - 170px)}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,43px);line-height:1.15;margin:7px 0 14px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 18px}p{margin:0 0 16px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#71bbff;font-weight:800}.pagehead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-bottom:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:17px;padding:26px;min-width:0}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px}.stats article span,.stats article small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.stats strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,31px);margin:12px 0}.stats small{font-size:12px}.blue{color:#6cbbff}.green{color:#69dcae}.red{color:#ff919b}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr;gap:22px}.sectionhead,.between,.entry,.entry-right{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.sectionhead{margin-bottom:15px}.sectionhead h2{margin:0}.entries{display:grid}.entry{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #273747}.entry:last-child{border-bottom:0}.entry small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.entry-right{flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}.entry strong{white-space:nowrap}.category{margin:18px 0}.category .between{font-size:13px}.track{height:9px;margin-top:8px;border-radius:20px;background:#25384d;overflow:hidden}.track\u003ediv{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1677d3,#60c3ff);border-radius:20px}.form{display:grid;gap:15px}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));align-items:end}.form label{display:grid;gap:7px;color:#cbd8e5;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}input,select{width:100%;min-width:0;padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #344b63;border-radius:9px;background:#0b1521;color:white;font:inherit}input:focus,select:focus{outline:2px solid #379eff;outline-offset:1px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 20px;background:#379eff;color:#06121d;border:0;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;min-height:46px}.button:hover{background:#66b8ff;text-decoration:none}.ghost,.danger{border:1px solid #38516b;border-radius:8px;background:#142234;color:#d8e7f5;padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer}.danger{border-color:#693a46;color:#ffb6c1;background:#2a1820;font-size:12px}.auth{max-width:460px;margin:45px auto}.auth h1{font-size:35px}.auth .form{margin:25px 0}.auth .button{width:100%}.alert{padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #2e6c55;background:#123528;color:#a7f4c9;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px}.alert.erro{border-color:#78434d;background:#321a23;color:#ffb9c4}.goal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:22px}.inline-form{grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;margin-top:20px}.note{margin-top:20px;font-size:12px}footer{text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:24px;color:#71879b;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:850px){.stats,.columns,.goal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{padding:18px 24px}.container{padding:35px 18px 65px}}@media(max-width:520px){.form-grid,.inline-form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top nav{gap:13px}.panel{padding:19px}.entry{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.entry-right{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}}\\nEOF\\ncd /mnt/data \u0026\u0026 zip -qr kbsistemas-finance.zip kbsistemas-finance \u0026\u0026 python -m py_compile /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/app.py \u0026\u0026 ls -lh /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance.zip\",{},{\"_456\":638,\"_458\":639,\"_383\":1135},1791991814.532673,{\"_451\":637,\"_452\":522},{\"_400\":328,\"_591\":17,\"_626\":17,\"_403\":404,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_415\":1131,\"_628\":-5,\"_629\":-5,\"_578\":602,\"_605\":1132,\"_631\":1133,\"_582\":1075,\"_588\":1077,\"_414\":50},\"171e0265-af5b-44a9-994e-93a3bf71129a\",[419],{\"_633\":522,\"_313\":635,\"_338\":1134},[],{},{\"_456\":457,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1151},1791991810.882128,1791991865.311239,{\"_451\":419,\"_656\":657,\"_658\":-5,\"_452\":1150},{\"_389\":1141,\"_391\":17,\"_392\":1142,\"_394\":1143,\"_400\":328,\"_591\":17,\"_626\":17,\"_403\":404,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_415\":1144,\"_628\":1145,\"_629\":1146,\"_578\":602,\"_605\":1147,\"_582\":1075,\"_588\":1077,\"_417\":1148,\"_414\":50},{\"_446\":447,\"_448\":1149},[],[],\"8ab7834e-7b1b-44d3-b967-02990cc56080\",[1146],\"Construindo projeto Flask financeiro completo em ZIP\",[419],[],[655],\"bash -lc mkdir -p /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/{templates,static/css} \u0026\u0026 cat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/requirements.txt \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\nFlask\u003e=3.0,\u003c4\\nFlask-SQLAlchemy\u003e=3.1,\u003c4\\npsycopg2-binary\u003e=2.9,\u003c3\\ngunicorn\u003e=22,\u003c24\\npython-dotenv\u003e=1,\u003c2\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/.env.example \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\nSECRET_KEY=troque-por-uma-chave-aleatoria-longa\\n# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://usuario:senha@host:5432/banco\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/.gitignore \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\n.env\\n.venv/\\n__pycache__/\\ninstance/\\n*.pyc\\nEOF\\ncat \u003e /mnt/data/kbsistemas-finance/app.py \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\nimport os\\nimport secrets\\nfrom datetime import date, datetime\\nfrom decimal import Decimal, InvalidOperation\\nfrom functools import wraps\\nfrom urllib.parse import urlparse\\n\\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\\nfrom flask import Flask, abort, flash, redirect, render_template, request, session, url_for\\nfrom flask_sqlalchemy import SQLAlchemy\\nfrom sqlalchemy import func\\nfrom werkzeug.security import check_password_hash, generate_password_hash\\n\\nload_dotenv()\\napp = Flask(__name__)\\napp.config['SECRET_KEY'] = os.getenv('SECRET_KEY', 'dev-only-change-this-key')\\nif os.getenv('RENDER') and not os.getenv('SECRET_KEY'):\\n    raise RuntimeError('Configure SECRET_KEY no Render antes de publicar.')\\ndb_url = os.getenv('DATABASE_URL', 'sqlite:///finance.db')\\nif db_url.startswith('postgres://'):\\n    db_url = db_url.replace('postgres://', 'postgresql://', 1)\\napp.config['SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI'] = db_url\\napp.config['SQLALCHEMY_TRACK_MODIFICATIONS'] = False\\napp.config['SESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY'] = True\\napp.config['SESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE'] = 'Lax'\\napp.config['SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE'] = bool(os.getenv('RENDER'))\\ndb = SQLAlchemy(app)\\n\\nclass User(db.Model):\\n    id = db.Column(db.Integer, primary_key=True)\\n    name = db.Column(db.String(100), nullable=False)\\n    email = db.Column(db.String(180), unique=True, nullable=False, index=True)\\n    password_hash = db.Column(db.String(255), nullable=False)\\n\\nclass Transaction(db.Model):\\n    id = db.Column(db.Integer, primary_key=True)\\n    user_id = db.Column(db.Integer, db.ForeignKey('user.id'), nullable=False, index=True)\\n    mode = db.Column(db.String(12), nullable=False)\\n    kind = db.Column(db.String(10), nullable=False)\\n    description = db.Column(db.String(160), nullable=False)\\n    category = db.Column(db.String(70), nullable=False)\\n    amount = db.Column(db.Numeric(12, 2), nullable=False)\\n    occurred_on = db.Column(db.Date, nullable=False, default=date.today)\\n    created_at = db.Column(db.DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow, nullable=False)\\n\\nclass Goal(db.Model):\\n    id = db.Column(db.Integer, primary_key=True)\\n    user_id = db.Column(db.Integer, db.ForeignKey('user.id'), nullable=False, index=True)\\n    mode = db.Column(db.String(12), nullable=False)\\n    title = db.Column(db.String(120), nullable=False)\\n    target = db.Column(db.Numeric(12, 2), nullable=False)\\n    saved = db.Column(db.Numeric(12, 2), nullable=False, default=0)\\n\\nMODES = {'pessoal': 'Pessoal', 'empresa': 'Empresarial'}\\nCATEGORIES = {\\n    'pessoal': ['Salário', 'Freelance', 'Alimentação', 'Moradia', 'Transporte', 'Saúde', 'Educação', 'Lazer', 'Outros'],\\n    'empresa': ['Vendas', 'Serviços', 'Investimento', 'Fornecedores', 'Funcionários', 'Impostos', 'Marketing', 'Aluguel', 'Outros'],\\n}\\n\\ndef login_required(fn):\\n    @wraps(fn)\\n    def wrapped(*args, **kwargs):\\n        if not session.get('user_id'):\\n            return redirect(url_for('login'))\\n        return fn(*args, **kwargs)\\n    return wrapped\\n\\n@app.before_request\\ndef csrf_guard():\\n    if '_csrf' not in session:\\n        session['_csrf'] = secrets.token_hex(24)\\n    if request.method == 'POST' and request.form.get('_csrf') != session['_csrf']:\\n        abort(400, description='Formulário inválido. Atualize a página e tente novamente.')\\n\\n@app.context_processor\\ndef template_globals():\\n    return {'csrf_token': session.get('_csrf'), 'mode': session.get('mode', 'pessoal'), 'modes': MODES, 'categories': CATEGORIES}\\n\\n@app.template_filter('brl')\\ndef brl(value):\\n    value = Decimal(value or 0)\\n    return 'R$ ' + f'{value:,.2f}'.replace(',', 'X').replace('.', ',').replace('X', '.')\\n\\ndef money(raw):\\n    try:\\n        value = Decimal(str(raw).strip().replace(',', '.'))\\n        if not value.is_finite() or value \u003c= 0 or value \u003e Decimal('9999999999.99') or value.as_tuple().exponent \u003c -2:\\n            raise ValueError()\\n        return value\\n    except (InvalidOperation, ValueError, TypeError):\\n        raise ValueError('Informe um valor positivo com até duas casas decimais.')\\n\\ndef current_mode():\\n    return session.get('mode', 'pessoal')\\n\\ndef owned(model, item_id):\\n    return model.query.filter_by(id=item_id, user_id=session['user_id']).first_or_404()\\n\\n@app.route('/')\\ndef index():\\n    return redirect(url_for('dashboard') if session.get('user_id') else url_for('login'))\\n\\n@app.route('/cadastro', methods=['GET', 'POST'])\\ndef cadastro():\\n    if request.method == 'POST':\\n        name = request.form.get('name', '').strip()\\n        email = request.form.get('email', '').strip().lower()\\n        password = request.form.get('password', '')\\n        if not 2 \u003c= len(name) \u003c= 100 or not 5 \u003c= len(email) \u003c= 180 or '@' not in email or len(password) \u003c 8:\\n            flash('Preencha os dados corretamente. A senha deve ter pelo menos 8 caracteres.', 'erro')\\n        elif User.query.filter_by(email=email).first():\\n            flash('Esse e-mail já está cadastrado.', 'erro')\\n        else:\\n            user = User(name=name, email=email, password_hash=generate_password_hash(password))\\n            db.session.add(user)\\n            db.session.commit()\\n            session.clear()\\n            session['user_id'] = user.id\\n            session['mode'] = 'pessoal'\\n            return redirect(url_for('dashboard'))\\n    return render_template('cadastro.html')\\n\\n@app.route('/login', methods=['GET', 'POST'])\\ndef login():\\n    if request.method == 'POST':\\n        email = request.form.get('email', '').strip().lower()\\n        password = request.form.get('password', '')\\n        user = User.query.filter_by(email=email).first()\\n        if user and check_password_hash(user.password_hash, password):\\n            session.clear()\\n            session['user_id'] = user.id\\n            session['mode'] = 'pessoal'\\n            return redirect(url_for('dashboard'))\\n        flash('E-mail ou senha incorretos.', 'erro')\\n    return render_template('login.html')\\n\\n@app.post('/sair')\\n@login_required\\ndef sair():\\n    session.clear()\\n    return redirect(url_for('login'))\\n\\n@app.post('/modo')\\n@login_required\\ndef trocar_modo():\\n    mode = request.form.get('mode')\\n    if mode not in MODES:\\n        abort(400)\\n    session['mode'] = mode\\n    return redirect(url_for('dashboard'))\\n\\n@app.route('/dashboard')\\n@login_required\\ndef dashboard():\\n    mode = current_mode()\\n    today = date.today()\\n    month_start = today.replace(day=1)\\n    q = Transaction.query.filter_by(user_id=session['user_id'], mode=mode)\\n    totals = dict(db.session.query(Transaction.kind, func.sum(Transaction.amount)).filter(\\n        Transaction.user_id == session['user_id'], Transaction.mode == mode,\\n        Transaction.occurred_on \u003e= month_start, Transaction.occurred_on \u003c= today\\n    ).group_by(Transaction.kind).all())\\n    income = totals.get('receita', Decimal('0')) or Decimal('0')\\n    expense = totals.get('despesa', Decimal('0')) or Decimal('0')\\n    balance = db.session.query(func.sum(db.case(\\n        (Transaction.kind == 'receita', Transaction.amount), else_=-Transaction.amount\\n    ))).filter(Transaction.user_id == session['user_id'], Transaction.mode == mode).scalar() or Decimal('0')\\n    recent = q.order_by(Transaction.occurred_on.desc(), Transaction.id.desc()).limit(6).all()\\n    by_category = db.session.query(Transaction.category, func.sum(Transaction.amount)).filter(\\n        Transaction.user_id == session['user_id'], Transaction.mode == mode,\\n        Transaction.kind == 'despesa', Transaction.occurred_on \u003e= month_start,\\n        Transaction.occurred_on \u003c= today\\n    ).group_by(Transaction.category).order_by(func.sum(Transaction.amount).desc()).all()\\n    user = db.session.get(User, session['user_id'])\\n    return render_template('dashboard.html', user=user, income=income, expense=expense,\\n                           balance=balance, recent=recent, by_category=by_category, today=today)\\n\\n@app.route('/movimentacoes', methods=['GET', 'POST'])\\n@login_required\\ndef movimentacoes():\\n    mode = current_mode()\\n    if request.method == 'POST':\\n        kind = request.form.get('kind')\\n        description = request.form.get('description', '').strip()\\n        category = request.form.get('category', '')\\n        try:\\n            amount = money(request.form.get('amount'))\\n            occurred_on = date.fromisoformat(request.form.get('occurred_on', ''))\\n            if kind not in ('receita', 'despesa') or not 1 \u003c= len(description) \u003c= 160 or category not in CATEGORIES[mode]:\\n                raise ValueError('Confira os campos do lançamento.')\\n            if occurred_on.year \u003c 2000 or occurred_on.year \u003e 2100:\\n                raise ValueError('Data inválida.')\\n            db.session.add(Transaction(user_id=session['user_id'], mode=mode, kind=kind,\\n                description=description, category=category, amount=amount, occurred_on=occurred_on))\\n            db.session.commit()\\n            flash('Lançamento cadastrado!', 'ok')\\n            return redirect(url_for('movimentacoes'))\\n        except ValueError as exc:\\n            flash(str(exc), 'erro')\\n    records = Transaction.query.filter_by(user_id=session['user_id'], mode=mode).order_by(\\n        Transaction.occurred_on.desc(), Transaction.id.desc()).limit(200).all()\\n    return render_template('movimentacoes.html', records=records, today=date.today())\\n\\n@app.post('/movimentacoes/\u003cint:item_id\u003e/excluir')\\n@login_required\\ndef excluir_movimentacao(item_id):\\n    item = owned(Transaction, item_id)\\n    if item.mode != current_mode():\\n        abort(404)\\n    db.session.delete(item)\\n    db.session.commit()\\n    flash('Lançamento excluído.', 'ok')\\n    return redirect(url_for('movimentacoes'))\\n\\n@app.route('/metas', methods=['GET', 'POST'])\\n@login_required\\ndef metas():\\n    mode = current_mode()\\n    if request.method == 'POST':\\n        title = request.form.get('title', '').strip()\\n        try:\\n            target = money(request.form.get('target'))\\n            if not 1 \u003c= len(title) \u003c= 120:\\n                raise ValueError('Informe um nome para a meta.')\\n            db.session.add(Goal(user_id=session['user_id'], mode=mode, title=title, target=target, saved=0))\\n            db.session.commit()\\n            flash('Meta criada!', 'ok')\\n            return redirect(url_for('metas'))\\n        except ValueError as exc:\\n            flash(str(exc), 'erro')\\n    goals = Goal.query.filter_by(user_id=session['user_id'], mode=mode).order_by(Goal.id.desc()).all()\\n    return render_template('metas.html', goals=goals)\\n\\n@app.post('/metas/\u003cint:item_id\u003e/adicionar')\\n@login_required\\ndef adicionar_meta(item_id):\\n    goal = owned(Goal, item_id)\\n    if goal.mode != current_mode():\\n        abort(404)\\n    try:\\n        amount = money(request.form.get('amount'))\\n        goal.saved += amount\\n        db.session.commit()\\n        flash('Progresso atualizado! Esse registro não altera seu saldo.', 'ok')\\n    except ValueError as exc:\\n        flash(str(exc), 'erro')\\n    return redirect(url_for('metas'))\\n\\n@app.post('/metas/\u003cint:item_id\u003e/excluir')\\n@login_required\\ndef excluir_meta(item_id):\\n    goal = owned(Goal, item_id)\\n    if goal.mode != current_mode():\\n        abort(404)\\n    db.session.delete(goal)\\n    db.session.commit()\\n    flash('Meta excluída.', 'ok')\\n    return redirect(url_for('metas'))\\n\\n@app.get('/health')\\ndef health():\\n    return {'status': 'ok'}\\n\\nwith app.app_context():\\n    db.create_all()\\n\\nif __name__ == '__main__':\\n    app.run(debug=os.getenv('FLASK_DEBUG') == '1')\\nEOF\",{},\"7efd22da-fa8f-44b8-9574-2ce15ce25f6d\",{\"_456\":1159,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1160},1791991775.463812,{\"_451\":452,\"_453\":1158},{\"_400\":328,\"_403\":404,\"_406\":811,\"_408\":409,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_413\":328,\"_327\":328,\"_415\":1157,\"_666\":17,\"_414\":50},\"f1003412-4f6c-43e9-9596-2189bb8196a1\",[522],\"system\",{},\"03b46c12-73a4-49af-ad3a-638d58ea1f9d\",{\"_456\":469,\"_458\":-5,\"_383\":1169},1791991771.73,1791991893.374394,{\"_451\":452,\"_453\":1167},{\"_406\":811,\"_466\":-5,\"_410\":812,\"_412\":812,\"_414\":50},[1168],\"Vamos desenvolver o KBSistemas Finance para finanças pessoais e empresariais. Comece pela estrutura do projeto e o código completo, passo a passo.\",{},\"70c6822